// Daily alerts by source
// Question: How has alert volume changed day by day over 30 days?
// Tables:   AlertInfo
// Workbook: Time chart - Building a Defender Security Dashboard with Workbooks, Part 3
//
// Author:   Seán O'Farrell - https://cloud-secure.ai/
// Runs as-is in Microsoft Defender advanced hunting.

AlertInfo
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| make-series Alerts = dcount(AlertId) default = 0 on Timestamp from startofday(ago(30d)) to now() step 1d by ServiceSource
